    {
      "id": "d4873458-9770-4285-9053-eb43fdcb7f5b",
      "name": "SidecarSolutions",
      "description": {
        "content": "Manage your sidecar solution's configuration. A sidecar solution is a unique solution built using the Visier platform, such as Smart Compensation. Use this API to retrieve the current settings, update the settings to new values, or delete existing settings.\n<br>**Note:** <em>This API is in **alpha**. While in alpha, APIs may change in a breaking way without notice; functionality may be removed, and no deprecation notices will be issued.\nIf you are interested in using this API, please contact your Customer Success Manager (CSM).</em>",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
